[60.463, "o", "NOTES:\r\n"]
[60.543, "o", "Rancher Server has been installed. Rancher may take several minutes to fully initialize.\r\n"]
[60.623, "o", "Please standby while Certificates are being issued, Containers are started and the Ingress rule comes up.\r\n"]
[60.703, "o", "Check out our docs at https://rancher.com/docs/\r\n"]
[60.783, "o", "## First Time Login\r\n"]
[60.863, "o", "If you provided your own bootstrap password during installation, browse to https://rancher.k3s.lab.internal to get started.\r\n"]
[60.943, "o", "If this is the first time you installed Rancher, get started by running this command and clicking the URL it generates:\r\n"]
[61.023, "o", "```\r\n"]
[61.102, "o", "echo https://rancher.k3s.lab.internal/dashboard/?setup=$(kubectl get secret --namespace cattle-system bootstrap-secret -o go-template='{{.data.bootstrapPassword|base64decode}}')\r\n"]
[61.182, "o", "```\r\n"]
[61.262, "o", "To get just the bootstrap password on its own, run:\r\n"]
[61.342, "o", "```\r\n"]
[61.422, "o", "kubectl get secret --namespace cattle-system bootstrap-secret -o go-template='{{.data.bootstrapPassword|base64decode}}{{ \"\\n\" }}'\r\n"]
[61.502, "o", "```\r\n"]
[61.582, "o", "Happy Containering!\r\n"]
